125 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 68 0 R/E(You tweak your CV. You hit "apply" again and again. You get nothing. No calls. No feedback. Just silence. And in the UAE? That silence can feel brutal.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

126 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 68 0 R/E(When I moved to Dubai, I was blown away. The diversity, the ambition, the heat, the food. But I also saw something else: thousands of highly qualified people stuck in job search limbo. People applying to 100+ jobs a week, pouring their energy into a system that never gave them a roadmap.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

127 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 68 0 R/E(I don\220t want that for you. That\220s why I wrote this guide. Not to just tell you how to job hunt, but to hand you the actual tools to win in this market.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

128 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 68 0 R/E(Because here\220s the truth. The UAE job market doesn\220t care how hardworking or talented you are. It cares how visible, how clear, and how strategic you are.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

129 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 68 0 R/E(I\220ve reviewed over 30,000 CVs and hired more than 1,000 people across Europe, the US, and the GCC. I\220ve been the recruiter. I\220ve been the candidate. I\220ve led teams who filled 20+ roles a month. And again and again, I saw amazing people getting ignored. Not because they weren\220t good enough, but because they didn\220t know how the system actually works.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

