150 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 69 0 R/E(Now, let\220s not sugarcoat it. A cover letter is not always required. Some companies won\220t even ask for it. But if they do? You give them one. End of story. No excuses. If they request it and you skip it, you\220re already giving someone else a better shot because you have just been rejected. Did you know that there are a looot of things automated in recruitment? Okay, I\220m getting ahead of myself... )/Pg 13 0 R/K[10]>>
