253 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 76 0 R/E(If you only apply through job portals, you\220ll miss a big part of the market. If you wait for recruiters to message you, you might be waiting for weeks. If you only network and never apply, you could be missing real roles that are already out there.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

254 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 76 0 R/E(In the UAE, you have to show up in more than one place. Some jobs are posted online. Some get filled before the ad is even written. Some are shared in WhatsApp groups, LinkedIn posts, or events. Some are filled by recruiters who already have someone in mind, and if they don\220t know you exist, they won\220t reach out.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

255 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 76 0 R/E(This part of the Playbook is all about action. You\220ve done the prep. Now it\220s about moving forward and getting visible. I\220ll show you how to work with recruitment agencies without wasting your time. I\220ll show you how to search properly on LinkedIn, how to follow companies and not just job ads, how to write messages that get replies, and how to use events and communities to make real connections.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

