endobj

261 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 77 0 R/E(So here\220s what to do. First, go to any AI tool. ChatGPT works perfectly fine. Tell it what experience you have, from which industries, and in which types of roles. Based on that, ask it to give you a list of 100 companies that operate in the UAE, or even just in Dubai or Abu Dhabi. )/Pg 21 0 R/K[1]>>
