endobj

265 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 77 0 R/E(Here\220s where most people mess it up. They start adding random people, or people who are at the same level as them. Do not do that. You are not here to add people who feel threatened by you. You are here to connect with the people who can actually open a door. That means people who are at least two levels above you.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

