1366 0 obj
<</Title(Your Experience section needs to match your CV but should never be a copy. LinkedIn plays a different role in the recruitment process, so it can\264t be written in the same way as your CV. Think of it like \215proof with personality.\216 What did you do? What impact did you make?)/Dest[15 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 1364 0 R/Next 1368 0 R>>
endobj

