1373 0 obj
<</Title(I know what recruiters want. I know how to help you pass each step. And I know how to make your profile finally get seen. If you're ready to stop guessing and start getting results, we can fix your CV, LinkedIn, and cover letter together. If you\220re not sure whether what you have is strong enough, just reach out. DM me on LinkedIn or email me and say:)/Dest[34 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 1375 0 R/Next 1371 0 R>>
